title: "melanoma_calib: a calibration-first, patient-disjoint benchmark on ISIC 2020"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for a study asking whether class-balanced objectives improve
  sensitivity at a fixed false-positive budget, and what they cost in calibration, under a
  frozen patient-disjoint split of the ISIC 2020 dermoscopy training set.
